{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Throne</strong> is a tower defense strategy game set in a dark, mist-shrouded world on the brink of collapse. As the ruler of the final kingdom still standing, you must command your defenses, outsmart relentless waves of monstrous creatures, and make crucial tactical decisions to hold your ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mist grows thicker. The monsters grow stronger. Will your kingdom be the last to fall\u2014or the last to endure?<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Defend the Last Kingdom</strong> \u2013 Strategically place towers and units to repel increasingly powerful waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f <strong>Survive the Mist</strong> \u2013 Face unique challenges from the mysterious mist that cloaks the battlefield and spawns terrifying foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Deep Strategy</strong> \u2013 Adapt your tactics, manage resources, and unlock powerful upgrades to turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Epic Battles</strong> \u2013 Engage in intense, fast-paced encounters with hordes of monsters determined to destroy your throne.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your defenses hold\u2014or will the last light of hope be snuffed out?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630360?t=1762670853","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630360/de2d0ff699d895c9599aab623348b92c8ae78cfb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762670853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630360/b8678f732646e6beb76c8601a62af985d106e566/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762670853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630360/b8678f732646e6beb76c8601a62af985d106e56